From: WP1 Audio (Agent 3) <audio@rg35xxh.local>
Subject: [PROPOSAL 1/3] jive_alsa: log negotiated PCM params on open
Date: 2026-11-15
Status: proposal (not applied; audio/alsa/proposals only)
Base: ralph-irving/squeezeplay@758bc11
File: src/squeezeplay/src/audio/decode/decode_alsa_backend.c

Today only the wire format + requested rate are logged at open; the
negotiated period/buffer sizes (which drive fifo autostart math and XRUN
behavior) are invisible unless stdout PCM dumps are enabled. Log one
summary line per successful open.

--- a/src/squeezeplay/src/audio/decode/decode_alsa_backend.c
+++ b/src/squeezeplay/src/audio/decode/decode_alsa_backend.c
@@ -780,6 +780,11 @@ static int _pcm_open(struct decode_alsa *state,
 	}
 	state->buffer_size = size;

+	LOG_INFO("Negotiated PCM %s: format=%s rate=%u ch=2 access=%s period=%lu buffer=%lu",
+		 device, snd_pcm_format_name(state->format), sample_rate,
+		 (access == SND_PCM_ACCESS_MMAP_INTERLEAVED) ? "mmap" : "rw",
+		 (unsigned long)state->period_size, (unsigned long)state->buffer_size);
+
 	/* iec958 control for playback device only */
 	if (!(state->flags & FLAG_STREAM_PLAYBACK) || mode != SND_PCM_STREAM_PLAYBACK) {
 		goto skip_iec958;
